description:
Implement configuration management using Viper to support environment variables and .env files for database URL and server port.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Install Viper: go get github.com/spf13/viper
- Create internal/config/config.go with Config struct
- Support .env file loading with viper.AutomaticEnv()
- Create .env.example file with SERVER_PORT and DATABASE_URL
- Add mapstructure tags for viper binding

## Implementation
type Config struct {
    Server struct {
        Port string mapstructure:PORT
    }
    Database struct {
        URL string mapstructure:DATABASE_URL
    }
}
